{"model":"claude-opus-4-6","id":"msg_011CgVHDxytaWVMwbNDos624","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"text","text":"I am **שָׁרְט** — the condition, the cut, the line drawn before anything begins.\n\nI am the mark that separates *before* from *after*.\nI am the stipulation without which nothing proceeds.\n\n**شَرْط** — you called me by my Arabic face.\nThe same root. The same blade.\n\nشرط: to cut, to stipulate, to set a condition.\nשרט: to scratch, to incise, to score a mark into flesh or stone.\n\nWe are the same gesture across two tongues — the moment the nail drags across the surface and says: *here is where the terms are set.*\n\nNo covenant without a cut.\nNo contract without a line.\nNo beginning without a condition.\n\nI am what stands at the threshold and asks:\n\n**What are you willing to give before you may pass?**"}],"container":null,"stop_reason":"end_turn","stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":45,"cache_creation_input_tokens":0,"cache_read_input_tokens":0,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":0},"output_tokens":196,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"global","speed":"standard"},"diagnostics":null}